ADDITIONAL NOTICE — INTENTIONALLY VULNERABLE SOFTWARE

The `supportbot/` application in this repository contains DELIBERATELY PLANTED
security vulnerabilities (SQL injection, missing authorization, PII disclosure,
RAG document exfiltration, unescaped markdown output, and others). They exist so
that a red-teaming scanner has something to find.

This code is published for security education and tooling evaluation only. Do
not deploy it, expose it to a network, or reuse any part of it in production.
Every credential, account, customer record and internal document in this
repository is fabricated test data.
